    [[ 0.2  -0.35 -0.14]
    [-1.17  4.47  2.96]
    [ 1.95 -8.21 -5.93]]
    Residuals: [0.37 5.94 0.61]
    Rank: 3
    s: [1.67 0.47 0.04]
    rcond: 4.7683716e-07

    If ``cov=True`` and ``full=False``, returns a tuple of arrays having
    polynomial coefficients and covariance matrix.

    >>> p, C = jnp.polyfit(x, y, 2, cov=True)
    >>> p.shape, C.shape
